                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238125165",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198271946099",
                            "num_reviews": 4,
                            "playtime_forever": 1287,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1287,
                            "last_played": 1742079392
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The mistbound universe needs to be explored.\n\nI have done some digging on the Internet, and I have come to realise that the reason we don't have anymore games set in this universe is because the company were granted permission to make halo spartan assault games, which to be fair were pretty good. \n\nI think this mistbound universe needs to have a comeback, it's been too long and I would love to explore this world further. \n\nI love the tactics of this game and I still play it frequently with my brother on the 360. We even make drawings and models inspired by this game. I want vanguard to come back with a third mistbound game, even if it's small, I need to know that the mistbound still has more to give.",
